.DS_Store
/atlas
# A privately curated ArcGIS city, registered from an init function; the
# public table in arcgismap.go carries only the proof city.
/internal/arcgismap/cities_local.go
/frontend/node_modules/
# The clean-room TypeScript lanes install at the repository root (npm
# workspaces); a workspace gets a link farm of its own beside its package.
/node_modules/
/analysis/node_modules/
/render/node_modules/
/.playwright-cli/
/output/
/crawl
/generate
/tiles
/cartograph
go.work
go.work.sum
/build/
/dist/

# The seam's built output. The bundle is an artifact of `make seam`; what is
# committed is the source it is built from (issue #5 §3.2: the app embeds
# render's built output, never its source).
render/dist/
.playwright-cli/

# The tree the hosts mount at /static: `make static` copies the seam's bundle
# in, the desktop shell embeds the directory, and only static/README.md is
# committed.
/static/*.js

# The desktop shell's own build products (`make desktop`).
/Atlas
/Atlas.exe
/Atlas.app/
